# Cisco IOS / NX-OS: show interfaces status
Value PORT (\S+)
Value NAME (\S.*?)
Value STATUS (connected|notconnect|disabled|err-disabled|inactive|monitoring|sfpAbsent|xcvrAbsent|noOperMem|down|up)
Value VLAN (\S+)
Value DUPLEX (\S+)
Value SPEED (\S+)
Value TYPE (\S.*?)

Start
  ^Port\s+Name -> Ports

Ports
  ^${PORT}\s+(?:${NAME}\s+)?${STATUS}\s+${VLAN}\s+${DUPLEX}\s+${SPEED}(?:\s+${TYPE})?\s*$$ -> Record
  ^-+
